{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shatter Point is a fast, fun, and exciting first person shooter. You grapple, run, jump and slide through 20 levels. This game is meant for speed running so please do so. And if you are looking for a short, fun, and FREE game, give it a download.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is short but still fun to play with the theme being set around a laboratory where your skills are tested and you try to make it to the end of the level as fast as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some skills that may help you during your testing are:\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Shotgun Jumping</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575600/extras/af37a4156f566e3cb3124bc1a092dd20.poster.avif?t=1750178278\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575600/extras/af37a4156f566e3cb3124bc1a092dd20.webm?t=1750178278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575600/extras/af37a4156f566e3cb3124bc1a092dd20.mp4?t=1750178278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Wall Running</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575600/extras/6724f91912f0ab26fd4d2ee69f83fe81.poster.avif?t=1750178278\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575600/extras/6724f91912f0ab26fd4d2ee69f83fe81.webm?t=1750178278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575600/extras/6724f91912f0ab26fd4d2ee69f83fe81.mp4?t=1750178278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Grappling</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575600/extras/cb96f56cf17392a4d169d4f40512d305.poster.avif?t=1750178278\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575600/extras/cb96f56cf17392a4d169d4f40512d305.webm?t=1750178278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575600/extras/cb96f56cf17392a4d169d4f40512d305.mp4?t=1750178278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>And of course Shooting</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575600/extras/303f74cfd8efcbffa7ef37b57f8675ed.poster.avif?t=1750178278\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575600/extras/303f74cfd8efcbffa7ef37b57f8675ed.webm?t=1750178278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575600/extras/303f74cfd8efcbffa7ef37b57f8675ed.mp4?t=1750178278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3575600?t=1750178278","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575600/fec080fbe898993f2c85ad7ad8df07132543fa17/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750178278","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575600/07b73fb669d5ca636ffea4499fed4b4f55102e60/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750178278","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/35756